            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.56

- The lyric line change now springs the way it was always meant to: one clear, elastic settle rather than the repeated shaking of the last two diagnostic builds. The give still grows with distance from the line being sung, so the movement reads as a wave down the stack.
- Removed the diagnostic instrumentation from the previous build.
]]></description>
